[gd_scene format=3]

; The variable is the editor marker of the three 2D joints, at the default, zero, long and negative
; `length` and `initial_offset`, and on a rotated and a scaled node. The golden turns the Gizmos toggle
; on. Godot draws the markers in a game only with collision debugging, so measure it with
; `pnpm ref:godot --mode 2d-root --debug-collisions`. No other golden has a 2D joint with it on, so none shows a regression in the marker.

